sentences.text:
In the result, the bail application is allowed by making the interim order dated 26.09.2024 absolute,
subject to the following conditions:
(i) The petitioner shall co-operate with the Investigating Officer and make himself available for interrogation as and when directed by the Investigating Officer ;

(v) The petitioner shall not leave India without the previous permission of the jurisdictional Court;
Liju P.J vs State Of Kerala on 10 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/102707726/
